WEBVTT

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:12.220
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>How to be happier</b>

00:00:13.393 --> 00:00:16.655
Happiness is very important for our mental health.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:24.350
These six tips will help you to be happier, more in control, and stronger in difficult times.

00:00:25.705 --> 00:00:28.755
<b>Tip one: Manage your stress levels</b>

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.773
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> If you have a lot of stress in your life,

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.192
organizing your time better will help you to stay in control.

00:00:38.239 --> 00:00:42.971
Plan regular exercise and make time for yourself every day.

00:00:43.933 --> 00:00:47.523
Do slow-breathing exercises to help you to relax.

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.679
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Tip two: Enjoy yourself</b>

00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:56.729
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Doing things that you enjoy is very good for you.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:02.683
Simple activities like watching sports with a friend, having a hot bath,

00:01:03.016 --> 00:01:06.740
or meeting friends for coffee can all improve your day.

00:01:07.661 --> 00:01:12.769
Doing something that you’re good at, for example, cooking or dancing,

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:19.783
is also a good way not only to enjoy yourself, but also to feel positive about yourself.

00:01:20.858 --> 00:01:26.868
Try to avoid things that seem enjoyable at the time, but make you feel worse afterwards,

00:01:27.507 --> 00:01:32.459
for example, going to bed very late or eating junk food.

00:01:33.825 --> 00:01:36.973
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Tip three: Boost your self-esteem</b>

00:01:38.412 --> 00:01:41.620
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Self-esteem is the way you feel about yourself.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:47.069
The best way to improve your self-esteem is to treat yourself the same way

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:51.495
you would treat a good friend, in a positive, but honest, way.

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:54.228
Control negative thoughts.

00:01:54.688 --> 00:01:59.343
Don’t say to yourself, ‘You’re so stupid for not getting that job’.

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:04.138
Instead think, ‘Would I say that to my best friend?’.

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:06.087
You probably wouldn’t.

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:10.654
Tell yourself something positive, for example,

00:02:11.134 --> 00:02:15.049
‘You’re an intelligent person, you’ll definitely get the next job.’

00:02:16.497 --> 00:02:19.543
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Tip four: Have a healthy lifestyle</b>

00:02:20.995 --> 00:02:22.903
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Make healthy choices.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:29.942
A balanced diet which includes the main food groups helps your brain and body work efficiently.

00:02:30.809 --> 00:02:36.652
Doing moderate exercise releases chemicals in your brain that make you feel happier,

00:02:36.971 --> 00:02:42.581
and help you to sleep better, have more energy, and keep your heart healthy.

00:02:43.449 --> 00:02:45.741
Choose an exercise that you enjoy.

00:02:46.385 --> 00:02:50.571
If it helps, do it with a friend or listen to music.

00:02:52.078 --> 00:02:54.979
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Tip five: Talk to other people</b>

00:02:56.426 --> 00:03:00.598
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Communication is important, whether it’s with a friend,

00:03:00.697 --> 00:03:03.889
a family member or even a therapist.

00:03:04.663 --> 00:03:09.655
Talking about things and sharing your feelings helps you to release tension.

00:03:10.348 --> 00:03:16.050
It also helps to make your relationships stronger, and to connect with people.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.982
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Tip six: Learn to deal with your problems</b>

00:03:22.455 --> 00:03:26.776
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Resilience is what allows you to cope with life’s ups and downs.

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:31.855
Making something good out of bad times helps you build your resilience.

00:03:32.747 --> 00:03:34.977
If you’re going through a difficult time,

00:03:35.127 --> 00:03:39.317
try making something creative out of your bad experiences.

00:03:39.849 --> 00:03:45.143
Things like writing, painting, or singing can help you to express your worries

00:03:45.359 --> 00:03:47.651
and see light at the end of the tunnel.